msgid ""
"The manifest carries SCORM 2004 sequencing rules. They are NOT applied: the "
"content will play its first SCO."
msgstr ""
"Le manifeste porte des règles de séquencement SCORM 2004. Elles ne sont PAS "
"appliquées : le contenu jouera son premier SCO."

#. module: bf_training_scorm
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_training_scorm/models/scorm_package.py:0
